  {
   "id": "t_8d25824050363a9627b0",
   "sourceHash": "8d25824050363a9627b069d24b3784adeefc55d63ca97b36fe735f46d43c9453",
   "text": "阿育吠陀疗养计划专属优惠 – Kairali 疗愈村",
